    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Kafra Teleportation",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Kafra Employee]\nProntera Field :\nThe Prontera West Field is a mountainous field that you can also access the ^ff0000Prontera Sewer^000000.\n^ff0000Hornets^000000 live there, so novice adventurers should beware!",
      "translation" : "[卡普拉 職員]\n普隆德拉野外：\n普隆德拉西部野外是一片多山的區域，從這裡也可以前往^ff0000普隆德拉下水道^000000。\n那裡有^ff0000蜂兵^000000出沒，初心者冒險者請多加小心！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Kafra Teleportation",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Kafra Employee]\nProntera Field :\nSouthwestern Prontera Field is a place where ^ff0000Rockers^000000 live.",
      "translation" : "[卡普拉 職員]\n普隆德拉野外：\n普隆德拉西南野外是^ff0000蝗蟲^000000的棲息地。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Kafra Teleportation",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Kafra Employee]\nProntera Field :\nProntera Lake Field is a place where the ^ff0000Ambernites^000000 live.",
      "translation" : "[卡普拉 職員]\n普隆德拉野外：\n普隆德拉湖邊野外是^ff0000蝸牛^000000的棲息地。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Kafra Teleportation",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Kafra Employee]\nArcher's Village :\nPayon's Cave is a scary place with lots of ^ff0000Zombies^000000 and ^ff0000Skeletons^000000.",
      "translation" : "[卡普拉 職員]\n弓箭手村莊：\n斐揚洞穴是一個令人恐懼的地方，那裡有很多^ff0000腐屍^000000和^ff0000邪骸戰士^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Kafra Teleportation",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "[Kafra Employee]\nSograt Desert :\nSouthwest of Prontera and Southwest of Izlude, this place is full of ^ff0000Mukas^000000 and ^ff0000Peco Pecos^000000.",
      "translation" : "[卡普拉 職員]\n蘇克拉特沙漠：\n位於普隆德拉西南方和依斯魯得島西南方，這裡到處都是^ff0000摩卡^000000和^ff0000大嘴鳥^000000。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 289,
      "npc" : "Kafra Teleportation",
      "state" : "needs_review",
      "text" : "I wish to go.",
      "translation" : "我要前往"
    },
